    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "Different types of AR experiences (which you configure using concrete [`ARConfiguration`](arconfiguration.md) subclasses) can have different hardware requirements.",
      "ko": "An [`ARWorldMap`](arworldmap.md) encapsulates the state of a running [`ARSession`](arsession.md).",
      "sourceHash": "b04c9838049a52d957281d22acc4a78a1995f3d7edf92d6985255322737d21d0",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0001",
      "source": "Before attempting to create an AR configuration, verify that the user’s device supports the configuration you plan to use by checking the [`isSupported`](arconfiguration/issupported.md) property of the corresponding configuration class.",
      "ko": "AR 구성을 생성하기 전에 해당 구성 클래스의 [`isSupported`](arconfiguration/issupported.md) 속성을 확인해 사용하려는 구성이 사용자 기기에서 지원되는지 검증합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "1c52d9580155a2cc4d2b517c1d4bcc8feb8014de054bfb4a944eadfd72c95006",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0002",
      "source": "If this property’s value is [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false), the current device does not support the requested configuration.",
      "ko": "이 속성 값이 [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false)이면, 현재 기기는 요청한 구성을 지원하지 않습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "a3ed6d697f29c7b5926309aca4993ff78290e367ed82c07c83afc0f325c714ba",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0012:0001",
      "source": "❗ **Important**: All ARKit configurations require an iOS device with an A9 or later processor.",
      "ko": "❗ **중요**: 모든 ARKit 구성은 A9 이상 프로세서를 갖춘 iOS 기기가 필요합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "cd081d5a583efe84a64832116afc92a4b1c8936729b496ae7ff9ac3b7b2b2ba6",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0012:0002",
      "source": "If your app otherwise supports other devices and offers augmented reality as a secondary feature, use this property to determine whether to offer AR-based features to the user.",
      "ko": "앱이 다른 기기를 지원하고 AR을 보조 기능으로 제공한다면, 이 속성을 사용해 사용자에게 AR 기반 기능을 제공할지 결정합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "cf21e955982995b3ed43b6a22302991f2d581c43a6403ccd7c32dccf014bbec8",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0012:0003",
      "source": "If your app requires ARKit for its core functionality, use the `arkit` key in the [`UIRequiredDeviceCapabilities`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/BundleResources/Information-Property-List/UIRequiredDeviceCapabilities) section of your app’s Info.plist to make your app available only on devices that support ARKit.",
      "ko": "앱의 핵심 기능에 ARKit가 필요하다면 앱의 Info.plist에서 [`UIRequiredDeviceCapabilities`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/BundleResources/Information-Property-List/UIRequiredDeviceCapabilities) 섹션의 `arkit` 키를 사용해 ARKit을 지원하는 기기에서만 앱을 사용할 수 있게 해야 합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "4f40e975aa774dc4d5f2e381b2717df5aad281b94f8878035c33d42596fadd2f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
